        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "1324cada-f56c-527b-a064-6671623ca63c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Capaldi, Paul King, Simon Farnaby, David Heyman\n- Products: Doctor Who, The Thick of It, Paddington, Paddington 2\n- Roles: the Doctor, Malcolm Tucker, Mr. Curry\n- Topics: acting awards, film production, film release\n\nFacts:\n- Peter Capaldi was born on 14 April 1958 and is a Scottish actor, writer, and director.\n- Peter Capaldi is best known for playing the twelfth Doctor in Doctor Who and Malcolm Tucker in The Thick of It.\n- Peter Capaldi received four British Academy Television Award nominations for The Thick of It and won Best Male Comedy Performance in 2010.\n- Peter Capaldi played Mr. Curry, Paddington Bear's neighbour, in the film Paddington.\n- Peter Capaldi was set to reprise the role of Mr. Curry in Paddington 2.\n- Paddington 2 is an upcoming British-French family-comedy film directed by Paul King.\n- Paddington 2 was co-written by Paul King and Simon Farnaby and produced by David Heyman.\n- Paddington 2 was set to be released on 10 November 2017.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "14ff786f-fd32-5d12-a7d3-f830345e2996",
        "text": "Page: Peter Capaldi. Sentence: Peter Dougan Capaldi (born 14 April 1958) is a Scottish actor, writer and director, best known for playing the twelfth incarnation of the Doctor in \"Doctor Who\" and as spin doctor Malcolm Tucker in \"The Thick of It\", for which he has received four British Academy Television Award nominations, winning Best Male Comedy Performance in 2010.\nPage: Peter Capaldi. Sentence: He further took on the role of Paddington Bear's neighbour Mr. Curry in the family comedy film \"Paddington\"; he is set to reprise the role in \"Paddington 2\".\nPage: Paddington 2. Sentence: Paddington 2 is an upcoming British-French family-comedy film directed by Paul King, co written by King and Simon Farnaby, and produced by David Heyman.\nPage: Paddington 2. Sentence: The film is set to release on 10 November 2017.",
